{{Hatnote|Sandbox samples for [[Template:Card/sandbox]] date rows. Live card articles are unchanged.}}
These pages try the proposed '''Info''' date block: '''Released''' (always when sourced), then optional '''Effective''', '''Remastered''', '''Blanked''', and '''Retired''', last before Versions. Empty rows omit. Dates are named fields; the template does not copy a set date automatically.

Printed title stays the printed title. '''(Remastered)''' is a wiki qualifier, not part of the card title (see [[SWCCG Wiki:Card date sample/Death Star: Trench remaster]]).

